This package rewrites the inference architecture in JavaScript and WGSL.
The upstream Python tree is not distributed in this package.
Tensor algebra, packed loaders and browser harness patterns were adapted from
this workspace's RFdiffusion, ESMC and EvoDiff implementations.

shared/numeric.js uses the SLEEF exponential polynomial (Boost Software
License 1.0) and Arm optimized-routines expf coefficients (MIT).
shared/quaternion.js implements the LAPACK lower Householder and implicit
QL/QR algorithms. LAPACK attribution and applicable third-party license texts
are in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.txt.
